\p{
    See my latest on [zkVMs and their proving backends](dhsorens-004K) — one page per system, from [leanVM's four opcodes](dhsorens-004L) through [Binius64](dhsorens-004M) and [Flock](dhsorens-004N) to the [benchmarks and why most of them are not comparable](dhsorens-004S), with references throughout. The systematic study behind it is [zkVMs and SNARKs](dhsorens-002C).
